@startuml
title Atm Scenario 1 — Polished Requirement Specification

[*] --> ChooseWithdrawalAmount
state "Choose Withdrawal Amount" as ChooseWithdrawalAmount
state "Select Predefined Amount" as SelectPredefinedAmount
state "Input Custom Amount" as InputCustomAmount
state CancelTransaction
state ReturnCard

ChooseWithdrawalAmount --> SelectPredefinedAmount : Select predefined amount
SelectPredefinedAmount --> InputCustomAmount : Enter custom amount
InputCustomAmount --> ChooseWithdrawalAmount : Invalid input / go back to choose withdrawal amount
CancelTransaction --> ReturnCard : Cancel transaction
ChooseWithdrawalAmount --> CancelTransaction : Cancel transaction

@enduml
